{"meta": {"id": "tmdb:85983", "type": "series", "name": "Suea Chani Keng", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XxQpwNF3B9rXWEQxWmmyDdccxx.jpg", "background": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/g3oW7B15ZlaQ98yZ2qMcInhQUn5.jpg", "logo": null, "description": "Three BFFs live in the same condominium building and face life and love together. Tum, a playboy photographer who doesn’t believe in true love because his girlfriend left him with a luxury condominium to pay off alone. Oil, Tum’s friend, offers to help him find a roommate to share the rent. Turns out the new roommate is Cheetah aka Chatree, Tum’s gay friend who used to be secretly in love with him. Tum cut off his friendship with Cheetah a long time ago because Cheetah tricked him to believe that he was straight.", "releaseInfo": "2016–2021", "genres": ["Drama"], "cast": ["Tanatat Chaiyaat", "Pongsak Rattanapong", "Rhatha Phongam", "Maprang Alrisa Kunkwaeng", "Natpongpon Suddee", "Jirawat Wachirasarunpat", "Suphitcha Subannaphong", "Pharunyoo Rojanawuttitham"], "imdbRating": "9.0", "released": "2016-07-24T00:00:00.000Z", "videos": [{"id": "tmdb:85983:1:1", "title": "Episode 1", "season": 1, "episode": 1, "released": "2016-07-24T00:00:00.000Z", "overview": "", "thumbnail": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o5iquKa3vgtgnTLbdyo2Oh0RHuf.jpg"}, {"id": "tmdb:85983:1:2", "title": "Episode 2", "season": 1, "episode": 2, "released": "2016-07-31T00:00:00.000Z", "overview": "", "thumbnail": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o5iquKa3vgtgnTLbdyo2Oh0RHuf.jpg"}, {"id": "tmdb:85983:1:3", "title": "Episode 3", "season": 1, "episode": 3, "released": "2016-08-07T00:00:00.000Z", "overview": "", "thumbnail": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o5iquKa3vgtgnTLbdyo2Oh0RHuf.jpg"}, {"id": "tmdb:85983:1:4", "title": "Episode 4", "season": 1, "episode": 4, "released": "2016-08-14T00:00:00.000Z", "overview": "", "thumbnail": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o5iquKa3vgtgnTLbdyo2Oh0RHuf.jpg"}, {"id": "tmdb:85983:1:5", "title": "Episode 5", "s